  "bio": "Kate Mackay Gill, a highly skilled tattoo artist, specializes in illustrative styles, captivating a base of roughly 70,000 followers on Instagram with her exquisite designs. Working from her private studio in Sussex, UK, Kate's evident talent draws clientele despite her self-professed status as a \"pathological worrier\". Her exceptional skill level is not only testament to her unwavering dedication but also a tribute to her beloved Darwin.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location:\n\nPathological worrier & nervous wreck Sponsored by your dog ✨ solo studio/w.sussex UK ✨hello.selkie@gmail.com email to book !🍋💛\nDoing it all for Darwin",
